touch_as_pointer for Hyprgrass, applied by build.py on top of the pin in build.py.

One finger on a window whose client never asked for wl_touch (Kitty) works as the pointer: past 12 px a
drag scrolls, otherwise lifting is a left click. Off by default; plugins.lua turns it on.

Proposed upstream as horriblename/hyprgrass#435 and closed there (the maintainer wants it in Hyprland).
This is the diff of that PR against the pinned commit; rebase it whenever the pin moves.

